{"4021880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fate of the Minotaur", "steam_appid": 4021880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/extras/bf922283fa35c95b0c2b73fdefcaa425.poster.avif?t=1765359520\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/extras/bf922283fa35c95b0c2b73fdefcaa425.webm?t=1765359520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/extras/bf922283fa35c95b0c2b73fdefcaa425.mp4?t=1765359520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>FATE OF THE MINOTAUR</strong> you embody the role of a human sacrifice from Athens who is sent into the labyrinth designed by the architect Daedalus. It was commissioned by King Minos of Crete to contain the ferocious Minotaur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout this 10-20 minute experience players will</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >enter the labyrinth below King Minos palace</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >navigate through it with an interactive torch to unveil the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gather insights into the ancient Greek myth by encountering key characters and narrating murals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >solve user-friendly puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >decide the fate of the Minotaur in a final confrontation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/extras/5d8de60e297563563c00477297858e06.poster.avif?t=1765359520\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/extras/5d8de60e297563563c00477297858e06.webm?t=1765359520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/extras/5d8de60e297563563c00477297858e06.mp4?t=1765359520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play by navigating through the scenery and interacting with your controllers.<br>We carefully minimized motion sickness through vignettes and seamless level transitions. A guiding thread will help you if you get lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development background information</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a unique approach, this content can be experienced in different immersive scale options, depending on the technical and physical limitations of the location presenting the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a technical perspective, a novel engine-agnostic and flexible open-source virtual production framework was used to realize the multiplayer network aspect of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the singleplayer only version. The 8x8m free-roaming or controller-based setup for up to 4 players is currently only to be played on-site at conferences/trade fairs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our stylized visual approach is inspired by ancient Greek murals and vases, allowing us to provide the experience with a small footprint in energy consumption and required equipment.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/extras/bf922283fa35c95b0c2b73fdefcaa425.poster.avif?t=1765359520\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/extras/bf922283fa35c95b0c2b73fdefcaa425.webm?t=1765359520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/extras/bf922283fa35c95b0c2b73fdefcaa425.mp4?t=1765359520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>FATE OF THE MINOTAUR</strong> you embody the role of a human sacrifice from Athens who is sent into the labyrinth designed by the architect Daedalus. It was commissioned by King Minos of Crete to contain the ferocious Minotaur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout this 10-20 minute experience players will</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >enter the labyrinth below King Minos palace</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >navigate through it with an interactive torch to unveil the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gather insights into the ancient Greek myth by encountering key characters and narrating murals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >solve user-friendly puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >decide the fate of the Minotaur in a final confrontation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/extras/5d8de60e297563563c00477297858e06.poster.avif?t=1765359520\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/extras/5d8de60e297563563c00477297858e06.webm?t=1765359520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/extras/5d8de60e297563563c00477297858e06.mp4?t=1765359520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play by navigating through the scenery and interacting with your controllers.<br>We carefully minimized motion sickness through vignettes and seamless level transitions. A guiding thread will help you if you get lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development background information</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a unique approach, this content can be experienced in different immersive scale options, depending on the technical and physical limitations of the location presenting the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a technical perspective, a novel engine-agnostic and flexible open-source virtual production framework was used to realize the multiplayer network aspect of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the singleplayer only version. The 8x8m free-roaming or controller-based setup for up to 4 players is currently only to be played on-site at conferences/trade fairs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our stylized visual approach is inspired by ancient Greek murals and vases, allowing us to provide the experience with a small footprint in energy consumption and required equipment.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Within this narrative VR experience FATE OF THE MINOTAUR, players descend into the mythical labyrinth, learn about the Minotaur’s tragic story and confront him to escape. ", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/a96c48860b2618379749f53efb1753aaccd8cce4/header.jpg?t=1765359520", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/88c1f933b5a37c2411c05854ddd9a6470ac4117e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765359520", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/88c1f933b5a37c2411c05854ddd9a6470ac4117e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765359520", "website": "https://emil-xr.eu/lighthouse-projects/fabw-location-based-xr/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64bit Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel™ Core™ i5-4590 equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce™ GTX 1060 / GTX 970 equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR or Oculus PC</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Filmakademie Baden-Wuerttemberg", "Animationsinstitut"], "publishers": ["Filmakademie Baden-Wuerttemberg", "Animationsinstitut"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 54, "description": "VR Only"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "37", "description": "Free To Play"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/be3f14eba8f97b83c2ed35a2fbe1758cd57055e3/ss_be3f14eba8f97b83c2ed35a2fbe1758cd57055e3.600x338.jpg?t=1765359520", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021880/be3f14eba8f97b83c2ed35a2fbe1758cd57055e3/ss_be3f14eba8f97b83c2ed35a2fbe1758cd57055e3.1920x10